Subject: [PATCH] Local pipeline: find the Python in the profile folder, show the real app version

The pipeline Python is now looked for in %USERPROFILE%\plaud-asr\.venv before
%LOCALAPPDATA%\plaud-asr\.venv: a venv made from a Store (MSIX) app such as the Claude desktop app
under AppData lands in that app's private folder and OpenPlod cannot see it. The install hint
and docs/local-pipeline.md explain this. The desktop app now passes its own version to the
service (OPENPLOD_APP_VERSION), used in /api/info and in each export's openplod.json.
---
